    "accessibility": {
      "short": "Oil painting of a man with reddish beard and hair, wearing a dark patterned jacket, against a vibrant speckled blue-green background.",
      "long": "A close-up portrait painted in oil, showing a man with fair skin, reddish-orange hair receding at the temples, and a full reddish beard. His eyes are light and fixed forward. He wears a dark jacket composed of tightly packed strokes of red, green, blue, and brown, over a white collar with a thin blue trim. The background is an active mosaic of short, directional dabs and strokes in deep blue, teal, and scattered orange, giving it a dynamic, almost vibrating quality. The lighting appears frontal and even, highlighting facial contours without strong shadows.",
